CloudBurrow patch 96 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1784). Applies after patch 0092; needs
googlesqlite patch 0095.

A query's default dataset names a project too: BigQuery's defaultDataset
"specifies the default datasetId and projectId to assume for any
unqualified table names in the query"
(https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/rest/v2/Job#jobconfigurationquery).
jobs.query and a query job ran the query in the job's project whatever
the default dataset's project, so `ds.t` with another project's default
dataset named the job's project's table. The engine's name path (which
googlesqlite patch 0095 reads a name of two parts in) is now the default
dataset's project when it gives one, the job's otherwise (namesProject).

cloudburrow_names_project_test.go (TestNamesProject).

